{"id":"2772d51949360c14","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-lachlan-game.md","title":"Lachlan 枚举博弈的阶段签名","display":"df-lachlan-game — Lachlan 枚举博弈的阶段签名","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-lachlan-game","aliases":["20-df-lachlan-game"],"display":"df-lachlan-game — Lachlan 枚举博弈的阶段签名","chapter":"2","section":"2.5","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 2.5.1；§16.2 的本地阶段展开","source_pdf_pages":[79,80],"source_printed_pages":[43,44],"depends_on":["[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-formula]]","[[20-df-satisfaction]]","[[20-df-pa]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-lachlan-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-lachlan-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lachlan-game — Lachlan 枚举博弈的阶段签名"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 2.5.1；§16.2 的本地阶段展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>79</span><span>80</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43</span><span>44</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{RB}=(F_{RB},R_{RB},a_{F,RB},a_{R,RB})\">\\(\\mathcal L_{RB}=(F_{RB},R_{RB},a_{F,RB},a_{R,RB})\\)</span> 是原固定有效语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{PA}\\subseteq F_{RB}\">\\(F_{PA}\\subseteq F_{RB}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{F,RB}\\upharpoonright F_{PA}=a_{F,PA}\">\\(a_{F,RB}\\upharpoonright F_{PA}=a_{F,PA}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot R,\\dot B\\in R_{RB}\">\\(\\dot R,\\dot B\\in R_{RB}\\)</span> 是不同标签，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{R,RB}(\\dot R)=a_{R,RB}(\\dot B)=2\">\\(a_{R,RB}(\\dot R)=a_{R,RB}(\\dot B)=2\\)</span>。不更换原符号及代码。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0\">\\(I_0\\)</span> 是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{RB}\">\\(F_{RB}\\)</span> 的固定解释表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0\\upharpoonright F_{PA}=I_{PA}\">\\(I_0\\upharpoonright F_{PA}=I_{PA}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0(\\ell):\\omega^{a_{F,RB}(\\ell)}\\to\\omega\">\\(I_0(\\ell):\\omega^{a_{F,RB}(\\ell)}\\to\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_0\">\\(J_0\\)</span> 是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{RB}\\setminus\\{\\dot R,\\dot B\\}\">\\(R_{RB}\\setminus\\{\\dot R,\\dot B\\}\\)</span> 的固定解释表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_0(\\ell)\\subseteq\\omega^{a_{R,RB}(\\ell)}\">\\(J_0(\\ell)\\subseteq\\omega^{a_{R,RB}(\\ell)}\\)</span>。这些表是显式声明的语言环境参数，不随 R、B 或对局改变；若原语言仅有算术与两个枚举关系，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0=I_{PA}\">\\(I_0=I_{PA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_0=\\varnothing\">\\(J_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal F^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal F^\\omega\\)</span> 为固定的允许红方走法集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{RB})\">\\(\\rho:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{RB})\\)</span> 是原有效给出的句子列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_e=\\rho(e)\">\\(\\rho_e=\\rho(e)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(\\mathcal P,\\rho)\">\\(G=(\\mathcal P,\\rho)\\)</span> 为固定游戏参数，不改变句子列或其代码。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为蓝方全策略函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,b\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\">\\(r,b\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(u\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,d,n,x,t\\in\\omega\">\\(s,d,n,x,t\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_s^f(r)\">\\(b_s^f(r)\\)</span> 按 s 作自然数递归，只调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_t^f(r)\">\\(b_t^f(r)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t&lt;s\">\\(t&lt;s\\)</span> 项；有限历史按原 seqcode 编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,B\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(R,B\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span> 用于下面的结构解释。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lachlan-game}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal F:=\\{u\\subseteq\\omega^2:|u|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak N_{R,B}:=(\\omega,I_0,J_0\\cup\\{(\\dot R,R),(\\dot B,B)\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{mcode}(u):=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:(n,x)\\in u\\}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{mdecode}(d):=\\{(\\pi_1(z),\\pi_2(z)):z\\in D_d\\},\\\\\nh_s^{f,r}:=\\{(2t,\\operatorname{mcode}(r_t)):t\\le s\\}\\cup\n\\{(2t+1,\\operatorname{mcode}(b_t^f(r))):t&lt;s\\},\\\\\nb_s^f(r):=\\operatorname{mdecode}(f(\\operatorname{seqcode}(h_s^{f,r}))),\\\\\nb_0^f(r)=\\operatorname{mdecode}(f(\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\{(0,\\operatorname{mcode}(r_0))\\}))),\\\\\nh_s^{f,r}\\in\\omega^{2s+1},\\qquad\nb^f(r):=\\{(s,b_s^f(r)):s\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nR(r):=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}r_s,\\qquad B(b):=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}b_s,\\\\\nU_n^r:=\\{x\\in\\omega:(n,x)\\in R(r)\\},\\qquad\nV_n^b:=\\{x\\in\\omega:(n,x)\\in B(b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ [\\mathfrak N_{R(r),B(b)}\\models\\rho_e],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningBlue}_G(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal P\\ \\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b^f(r)),\\\\\nA^{f,r}:=V_0^{b^f(r)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinBlue}(r,b)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WinningBlue}(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{WinningBlue}_G(f).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lachlan-game}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal F:=\\{u\\subseteq\\omega^2:|u|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak N_{R,B}:=(\\omega,I_0,J_0\\cup\\{(\\dot R,R),(\\dot B,B)\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{mcode}(u):=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:(n,x)\\in u\\}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{mdecode}(d):=\\{(\\pi_1(z),\\pi_2(z)):z\\in D_d\\},\\\\\nh_s^{f,r}:=\\{(2t,\\operatorname{mcode}(r_t)):t\\le s\\}\\cup\n\\{(2t+1,\\operatorname{mcode}(b_t^f(r))):t&lt;s\\},\\\\\nb_s^f(r):=\\operatorname{mdecode}(f(\\operatorname{seqcode}(h_s^{f,r}))),\\\\\nb_0^f(r)=\\operatorname{mdecode}(f(\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\{(0,\\operatorname{mcode}(r_0))\\}))),\\\\\nh_s^{f,r}\\in\\omega^{2s+1},\\qquad\nb^f(r):=\\{(s,b_s^f(r)):s\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nR(r):=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}r_s,\\qquad B(b):=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}b_s,\\\\\nU_n^r:=\\{x\\in\\omega:(n,x)\\in R(r)\\},\\qquad\nV_n^b:=\\{x\\in\\omega:(n,x)\\in B(b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ [\\mathfrak N_{R(r),B(b)}\\models\\rho_e],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningBlue}_G(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal P\\ \\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b^f(r)),\\\\\nA^{f,r}:=V_0^{b^f(r)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinBlue}(r,b)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WinningBlue}(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{WinningBlue}_G(f).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限历史的偶数位置仍是截至本阶段的红方走法，奇数位置仍是此前的蓝方走法；传入 f 的自然数代码未改变。h 的定义域为 2s+1，所以 seqcode 的输入确为有限序列。</p>\n<p>原“通常算术解释”现在由 PA 的解释表提供；原语言可能含有的其他符号保留在显式环境解释表中，红、蓝两个关系符号分别解释为最终枚举关系。省略 G 的谓词仍是同一固定游戏环境中的别名，不再依赖 Remark 才能恢复游戏参数。第一蓝列 A、所有走法编码及胜负谓词名称保持不变。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.5.1；印刷 43–44 / PDF 79–80；§16.2 的编码解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pa","status":"resolved","id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pa","status":"resolved","id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{RB}=(F_{RB},R_{RB},a_{F,RB},a_{R,RB})","display":false},{"tex":"F_{PA}\\subseteq F_{RB}","display":false},{"tex":"a_{F,RB}\\upharpoonright F_{PA}=a_{F,PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot R,\\dot B\\in R_{RB}","display":false},{"tex":"a_{R,RB}(\\dot R)=a_{R,RB}(\\dot B)=2","display":false},{"tex":"I_0","display":false},{"tex":"F_{RB}","display":false},{"tex":"I_0\\upharpoonright F_{PA}=I_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"I_0(\\ell):\\omega^{a_{F,RB}(\\ell)}\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"J_0","display":false},{"tex":"R_{RB}\\setminus\\{\\dot R,\\dot B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"J_0(\\ell)\\subseteq\\omega^{a_{R,RB}(\\ell)}","display":false},{"tex":"I_0=I_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"J_0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal F^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{RB})","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_e=\\rho(e)","display":false},{"tex":"G=(\\mathcal P,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"r,b\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"s,d,n,x,t\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b_s^f(r)","display":false},{"tex":"b_t^f(r)","display":false},{"tex":"t<s","display":false},{"tex":"R,B\\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lachlan-game}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal F:=\\{u\\subseteq\\omega^2:|u|<\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak N_{R,B}:=(\\omega,I_0,J_0\\cup\\{(\\dot R,R),(\\dot B,B)\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{mcode}(u):=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:(n,x)\\in u\\}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{mdecode}(d):=\\{(\\pi_1(z),\\pi_2(z)):z\\in D_d\\},\\\\\nh_s^{f,r}:=\\{(2t,\\operatorname{mcode}(r_t)):t\\le s\\}\\cup\n\\{(2t+1,\\operatorname{mcode}(b_t^f(r))):t<s\\},\\\\\nb_s^f(r):=\\operatorname{mdecode}(f(\\operatorname{seqcode}(h_s^{f,r}))),\\\\\nb_0^f(r)=\\operatorname{mdecode}(f(\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\{(0,\\operatorname{mcode}(r_0))\\}))),\\\\\nh_s^{f,r}\\in\\omega^{2s+1},\\qquad\nb^f(r):=\\{(s,b_s^f(r)):s\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nR(r):=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}r_s,\\qquad B(b):=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}b_s,\\\\\nU_n^r:=\\{x\\in\\omega:(n,x)\\in R(r)\\},\\qquad\nV_n^b:=\\{x\\in\\omega:(n,x)\\in B(b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ [\\mathfrak N_{R(r),B(b)}\\models\\rho_e],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningBlue}_G(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal P\\ \\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b^f(r)),\\\\\nA^{f,r}:=V_0^{b^f(r)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinBlue}(r,b)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WinningBlue}(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{WinningBlue}_G(f).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":4109,"backlinks":[{"id":"711da376393d5bc5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lachlan-game]]；see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-thm-graph]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"0ec3e4391cca9764","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lachlan-game]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-lachlan-game]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-445","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-lachlan-game]] — 章 2；直接提供者 5 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-445","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-lachlan-game]]"}],"outgoing":["59004ac6d23e86f8","9885f96cf9cb2fff","35073b74f84433b3","0c35680c0004f5e2","d4a7833057f5a20e","4e01ee20e163d443"]}